{"availability":"available","full":"emadprograms/data-harvester","name":"data-harvester","description":"An advanced market data harvester built with Python & Streamlit. Uses a hybrid strategy to stitch 1-minute candles from Binance, Yahoo Finance, and Capital.com into a gap-free Turso database. Includes automated GitHub Actions workflows.","category":"Finance","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2025-11-13T06:53:07Z","updated":"2026-10-08T16:04:40Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://data-harvester.streamlit.app/","topics":["etl","financial-data","libsql","market-data","python","stock-market","streamlit","turso","yfinance"],"demo":"https://data-harvester.streamlit.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:42.507Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:42.507Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:42.507Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T08:00:42.507Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A high-performance market data harvesting, 24/7 live tick streaming, and telemetry observability engine powered by a Partitioned Parquet Tick Lake, zero-lock multi-process concurrency, sub-100ms in-memory DuckDB analytical resampling, and interactive financial charting.","Current milestone: v6.0 checkout is complete. New rows store bid and ask prices. The lake already on disk is still schema v1 until the owner runs the rewrite locally. v5.0 remains the storage baseline: the partitioned Parquet tick lake is the only store, no runtime path creates a .duckdb file, and the streaming scope is the 19 approved US equities, weekdays 04:00–20:00 ET.","New rows store bidprice and askprice only, plus timestamp, symbol, source, session, and ingestid. Do not read price or volume as the stored quote. Capital.com stores its quote-change bid and ask. Databento tbbo stores bidpx00 as bidprice and askpx00 as askprice. Fewer Databento rows than Capital.com rows is accepted."],"features":[],"source